
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Manager Invitation - <%= businessName %>
    </title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background-color: #2563eb; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px;">
                You're Invited!
            </h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px;">
                <%= businessName %>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">
            <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333333;">
                Hello <%= name %>,
            </h2>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                You have been invited to join <%= businessName %> as a Manager.
                    We are pleased to invite you to take on this role and become
                    part of the team.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                As a Manager, you will have access to the management features
                and responsibilities assigned to your role within
                <%= businessName %>.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                To accept this invitation and get started, please click
                the button below.
            </p>

            <!-- Invitation Button -->
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= invitationLink %>" style="
                    display: inline-block;
                    padding: 14px 28px;
                    background-color: #2563eb;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    text-decoration: none;
                    border-radius: 5px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                ">
                    Accept Invitation
                </a>
            </div>

            <p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                This invitation will expire in 5 days. Please accept it
                before it expires.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely
                ignore this email. No action is required.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact
                the person who invited you or the relevant support team.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #333333; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Best regards,<br />
                The <%= businessName %> Team
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #999999; font-size: 12px;">
                &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
                    <%= businessName %>. All rights reserved.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>
